sequenceDiagram
  title One trial, one waiting caller
  participant p0 as Trial
  participant p1 as Breaker
  participant p2 as Caller
  Note over p0,p2: Possible ordering#59; default single trial<br/>Q: scope and conditions
  p0->>p1: I1 · Request trial
  Note over p1: I2 · Start trial
  p2->>p1: I3 · Request while trial pending
  Note over p1,p2: I4 · Await recovery
  Note over p0: I5 · Work completes
  p0-->>p1: I6 · Report outcome
  Note over p1: I7 · Classify outcome
  alt B1 · Counted success
  Note over p1: I8 · Close#59; release waiter
  Note over p1,p2: I9 · Recheck admission
  Note over p1: I10 · Run work [still Closed]
  else B2 · Counted failure
  Note over p1: I11 · Reopen#59; release waiter
  Note over p1,p2: I12 · Recheck admission
  p1-->>p2: I13 · Refuse [delay unelapsed]
  end
